Goal:

- Track the lastRejectionTime and rejectionCounts for each instance of the invoice by setting rejectionCounts and lastRejectionTime property on the class definition as an object with the id of each invoice as property with their corresponding value.
- The initial status of the invoice should be set as "pending", while the expiryDate should be 5 days after the initial date of creation.
- Buyer should be able to accept or decline an invoice sent, by making a call to handlePaymentAction with parameters 
    - action - "accept" or "decline"
    - payload - {id: invoiceId} 
- Add a feature that allows the user to set the status of all pending invoices to "expired" if they are not accepted or declined after 5 days of creation by making a call to handlePaymentAction  with action set to "checkExpiry" 
-  Invoice can only be sent after being declined twice in  the last 24hrs
- if the user has already accepted an invoice, a call to handlePaymentAction with an action parameter equals "decline" should not modify the status of the particular invoice.
